Taiwan","TfL is a member of Electronics Watch, and works with the organisation to address the human and labour rights risks in the ICT supply chains. Where risk are identified - Electronics Watch supports enforcement of our contract obligations. It worked to ensure good outcomes like a final assembly facility in India has no late payments of bonuses anymore and this did not recur. Also 158 Burmese Migrants were refunded for fees paid to secure their job. We use our leverage to aid this.",E-scooter batteries. Workers manufacturing in global supply chains with forced labour and labour rights risk.,Within your supply chains,"Tier 2 suppliers
