Supporting victims via NGO",No,"We will strengthen our HRDD processes by creating a new ethical sourcing action plan template, addressing gaps identified through Electronics Watch, deepen supply chain mapping. We will update our risk assessment in 2026/27 and adjust the key suppliers list by including more risk factors, e.g. MSAT scores and supply chain mapping data. We will repeat MSAT campaign, providing training/follow ups to suppliers scoring below 70% and track progress through KPIs on supplier engagement and performance.",2026-10-13T16:08:25,https://downloads.modern-slavery-statement-registry.service.gov.uk/pdf-published/EzzusHKG/2026/tfl-modern-slavery-statement-2025-26-signed.pdf
