Workers within your organisation",No,Third party audit arranged by your supplier,No,"Using anonymous whistleblowing services, such as a helpline or mobile phone app",No,,No,MERCHANDISE BUSINESS SALE AND MANUFACTURE OF APPAREL AND OTHER GOODS HIGH RISK AS TEXTILES IS GLOBALLY RECOGNISED AS A HIGH RISK INDUSTRY,Within your supply chains,Tier 1 suppliers,Children,,India,"OUR PROCUREMENT PROCESS INVOLVES INITIATIVES TO IDENTIFY AND MITIGAGE RISK. LARGER RETAIL PARTNERS ARE AUDITED, WE USE SEDEX REGISTERED SUPPLIERS TOPROTECT WORKERS FROM UNSAFE CONDITIONS, FORCED LABOURETC",AS ABOVE,Within your supply chains,Tier 1 suppliers,Children,,China,"OUR PROCUREMENT PROCESS INVOLVES INITIATIVES TO IDENTIFY AND MITIGAGE RISK. LARGER RETAIL PARTNERS ARE AUDITED, WE USE SEDEX REGISTERED SUPPLIERS TO PROTECT WORKERS FROM UNSAFE CONDITIONS, FORCED LABOUR ETC.SUPPLIERS FOR OUR MERCHANDISE SIGN AGREEMENTS WHICH REQUIRES THEM TO COMPLY WITH APPLICABLE LABOUR LAWS FOR MANUFACTURING OPERATIONS .",AS ABOVE,Within your supply chains,Tier 1 suppliers,Children,,Turkey,"OUR PROCUREMENT PROCESS INVOLVES INITIATIVES TO IDENTIFY AND MITIGAGE RISK. LARGER RETAIL PARTNERS ARE AUDITED, WE USE SEDEX REGISTERED SUPPLIERS TO PROTECT WORKERS FROM UNSAFE CONDITIONS, FORCED LABOUR ETC.SUPPLIERS FOR OUR MERCHANDISE SIGN AGREEMENTS WHICH REQUIRES THEM TO COMPLY WITH APPLICABLE LABOUR LAWS FOR MANUFACTURING OPERATIONS.",,Yes,,,"THROUGH OUR MERCHANDISE BUSINESS , WE ARE COGNISANT THAT HERE THERE IS A GREATER RISK OF MODERN SLAVERY AND HUMAN TRAFFICKING IN OUR SUPPLY CHAIN. WE MINIMISE SUCH RISKS BY SELECTING SUPPLIERS WHO SHARE OUR COMMITMENT TO HUMAN RIGHTS AND INCORPORATING OUR SUPPLIER SOCIAL RESPONSIBILITY POLICY INOT OUR MANUFACTURING AGREEMENTS",2026-07-03T11:28:06,https://downloads.modern-slavery-statement-registry.service.gov.uk/pdf-published/EjTARks0/2026/Modern Slavery Statement 2026 for FY 2025.pdf
