Through trade unions or other worker representative groups",No,"We monitor working conditions internally through culture surveys and colleague engagement. We monitor suppliers through SMETA audits, health and safety checks, and worker voice surveys.",No,The flow of illicit funds through our accounts,Within your own operations,,"Women
Migrants
Refugees
Children",,United Kingdom,"Nationwide will further improve controls that detect and disrupt potential modern slavery through customer due diligence, transaction monitoring and enhanced typologies. We will use intelligence from law enforcement, Public-Private Partnerships and specialist partners to improve detection of suspicious flows and escalate concerns to the NCA where required.",Labour exploitation in our supply chain,Within your supply chains,"Tier 1 suppliers
Tier 2 suppliers
